  "details": "Attach any object that is visible (with a mesh for example) to a part of an avatar that is a physbone\n\nAnimate that object to rotate through the animator and animation tabs\n\nVerify that the object rotates and is attached to the physbone in play mode\n\nUpload to vrchat\n\nThe object that rotated around the physbone in the unity editor playtest will not be rotating at all in game. \n\nAnimated transforms still seem to work, just rotation seems to be broken and only when it's attached to a physbone.\n\nApologies if this is a duplicate, my original bug report doesn't seem to have gone through or something.",
